ntire personality has been  altered to reflect the personality of  the demon we will need more information  in order to know for sure but this brief  line could definitely be a warning to  hasta the more he reaches into the  demons power in  to get stronger the more his personality  and his very humanity could be affected  for his part Yami dismisses Dante's talk  about acquiring other mages as if they  were yugioh cards or something Yami says  that the arcane stage mages who are  members of the black bulls are not  objects he acquired but people he likes  to hang out with and genuinely likes  Yami also proclaims that he will not  give up a single one of them to the  likes of Dante as Dante tries to attack  Yami again Yami uses the move called  dark cloaked AI slash to seemingly cut  right through Dante's abdomen and that  is how this action-packed  chapter ends it sure looks like Yami  just dealt a deadly blow to Dante but  come on bruh there is no way that Dante  will actually be defeated so easily  if freaking gauche survived that massive  wound to the torso then I fully expect  Dante to survive this attack by ami  especially since Dante has access to  demon powers with that said I would like  to say a few words about this new Yami  attack called dark cloaked a I slash the  word AI is a reference to a Idol a  Japanese martial art of swiftly drawing  one sword and stopping an opponent's  attack with incredible speed I am  familiar with this martial art because I  actually have a black belt in E I doe  but to be fair having a black belt it  does not make you a martial arts master  I think that a lot of people who haven't  done martial arts have the wrong idea  about what being a black belt meets  because having a black belt means that  you have earned the title of senpai or  upperclassman in order to earn the title  of Master you must go far beyond just a  black belt showdown or first on with  that said I am familiar enough with the  idol to appreciate this reference the I  do is both a martial art and a  philosophy and it emphasizes strict  discipline and constant awareness it  also emphasizes quick decisive movements  which stop your opponent in their tracks  before they can even get warmed up yet  oh is about reacting before your  opponent and taking them out quickly and  efficiently it's also about reacting to  threats posed by others it's not about  being the aggressor yourself but as much  as I respect the Iaido reference and  Yami's impressive form it's highly  unlikely that this one impressive strike  will actually defeat Dante a regular  strong mage probably but an evil madman  who runs on pure demon juice not bloody  likely also a side note but if Yami was  caught smoking a cigarette while  performing he item moves like he did in  this chapter his yo-yo master would  immediately rip him a new black hole in  my experience he Ida requires firm  discipline and strict etiquette  absolutely no eccentricity is allowed  but as you guys can tell I really  enjoyed this chapter both from the  perspective of my swordsmanship  experience and from the perspective of  all the useful information that has been  revealed I am loving the Dante versus  Yami fight so far and I predict that it  is not over yet  I am also extremely curious about the  fact that Yami and his dark magic are a  key to the demon world what exactly does  this mean for the rest of the story and  what role is Yami about to play in this  massive war between the demons and the  humans be sure to let me know what you  guys think about all of this down in the  comments below is Yami going to end up  with a demon power of his own or is his  magic going to be used to open a portal  between the human world and the demon  world which would potentially allow an  entire army of demons to enter this  world in order to possess a whole bunch  of new human vessels is this the  ultimate goal of the dark triad a total  demon takeover of the human world I mean  that's probably why they want all those  arcane staged mages they want them to  become vessels for the demons  maybe the Spade Kingdom itself is just a  cover that the demons are using in order  to achieve total demon domination of the  world they don't actually care about the  Spade Kingdom itself they are just using  this kingdom and its armies to  educate all human kingdoms in the name  of the demons maybe the ultimate goal of  the dark triad is to conquer the entire  world open the portal to the demon world  and allow thousands of demons to pour in  and completely subjugate all of humanity  I am very curious to find out more about  all of this and I'm also curious to read  your takes down in the comments if you  enjoyed this video and you want to see  more black louver content right here on  the channel please leave a like to let  me know it really does help and if you  have it to be new to anime uproar or you  just haven't subscribed yet please  consider subscribing and hitting that  bell to turn on all notifications if you  want to be notified and you don't want  to miss our videos you really have to go  through the trouble of clicking that  bell and selecting the option that says  oh you could also hit me up on Twitter  and or Instagram acts anime uproar I  want to give a huge thank you to all of  our anime uproar patrons who make videos  like this one possible special thanks to  baby R a disciple of Lord we go himself  and I can't forget all are the one tear  patrons the ones who rise above all  other clans including Ingrid ah a  lowland Adam the world stealers the  school bus Tyson query know a quiet  respect pat a heffa and chris loki  finally big thanks to all of our pro  hero tier patrons including the one and  only Gilgamesh nothing but a fan Jason  Wilson Odin Anatole Kazuki alpha do on  hell Cruz team Sparky 65 Rohan Kapoor  cricket XP fit edala beat Ted no Ted  Salter Joe Stanton very gucci jessica  calif on alicia actor levi emperor otaku  and JC c waka if you enjoy